              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Metric definitions. Reach is people with any Cowork activity in the selected period divided by the analytical population. Sustained use is people classified as Power or Habitual using available covered weeks up to the selected cap, divided by the analytical population. Each gap is the department share minus the company share in percentage points. Results below 10 people are suppressed.'"
